    "body": "Oh :(.\r\n\r\nThis is basically about what happens when you try to edit a display: contents element: Should it work? If so, where does the edited text go? (display: contents has no box, so there's no scope where you can put it, really).\r\n\r\nAlso, Gecko right now creates a UI for `document.designMode`, which includes a resizer, etc around the editor root. What should happen to those if the editing root has display: contents?",
