    "created_at": "2018-02-16T23:26:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-16T23:26:51Z",
    "body": "The effects on descendants of being editable shouldn't be affected by the root element being `display:contents`, I would think.  Is there some non-obvious connection that makes it difficult?\r\n\r\nAnything that wants to display some UI on the root element is definitely affected, since said element has no box and doesn't show up in the tree. I presume it just wouldnt' generate the UI in that case?",
